MAM4-JAX is a JAX port derived from the following upstream work:

1. PNNL MAM_box_model (Kai Zhang et al.), GPL-3.0
   The Fortran box model vendored under mam4-original-src-code/ is copied
   from this code, and MAM4-JAX follows its test driver.

2. E3SM MAM4 (E3SM-Project), BSD-3-Clause
   The MAM4 aerosol code in the box model derives from the E3SM
   atmosphere model.

3. CAM / CESM (UCAR/NCAR), CESM Copyright and Terms of Use (BSD-style)
   E3SM's MAM4 code in turn derives from CAM, copyright UCAR.

Vendored parent sources under mam4-original-src-code/ retain their own
license and copyright notices (see mam4-original-src-code/LICENSE) and are
not relicensed by this file.
